@startuml kairos-view-event-details-sequence
title View Events Calendar and Event Detail

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open Events Calendar
MemberApp -> API: GET /events?from=...&to=...
API -> DB: SELECT events in range
DB --> API: Events list
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {events}

Member -> MemberApp: Click an event
MemberApp -> API: GET /events/{eventId}
API -> DB: SELECT event + registration status
DB --> API: detail
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {eventDetail}

MemberApp --> Member: Show Event Detail page

@enduml
